msgstr "Datamosh"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/fun_pack.rs:53
msgid "Add a clone, move somewhere else and add another."
msgstr "添加一个克隆，换个位置再添加一个。"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/fun_pack.rs:54
msgid "Take the empty room, then step back in."
msgstr "先拍下空房间，然后再走回画面。"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/fun_pack.rs:55
msgid "Move a torch or a phone screen around in the dark."
msgstr "在黑暗中移动手电筒或手机屏幕。"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/fun_pack.rs:56
msgid "Each band of the picture runs a little behind the one before."
msgstr "画面的每一条带都稍稍落后于前一条。"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/fun_pack.rs:57
msgid "A stick figure takes your place."
msgstr "由火柴人代替你。"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/fun_pack.rs:58
msgid "Move around and the picture smears instead of refreshing."
msgstr "四处移动时，画面会拖影而不是刷新。"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/fun_pack.rs:73
msgid "How long the light trails last."
msgstr "光轨保留的时长。"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/fun_pack.rs:74
msgid "How bright a light has to be to paint."
msgstr "多亮的光源才能留下光绘轨迹。"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/fun_pack.rs:75
msgid "How many frames pass between one end of the picture and the other."
msgstr "画面从一端过渡到另一端所跨越的帧数。"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/fun_pack.rs:76
msgid "How many extra times each frame's motion is played."
msgstr "每一帧的动态效果额外重放的次数。"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/fun_pack.rs:452
