msgstr "请离开画面。短暂倒计时后将拍下空背景。"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/fun_pack.rs:453
msgid "Get in place. The clone is taken after a short countdown."
msgstr "请站好位置。短暂倒计时后将定格分身。"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/fun_pack.rs:454
msgid "Let the next keyframe through to restore the picture."
msgstr "放行下一关键帧以恢复正常画面。"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/fun_pack.rs:455
msgid "Remove all clones, or all light trails in Light painting."
msgstr "清除所有分身，或清除光绘中的所有光轨。"

#: rust/crates/effects/src/fun_pack.rs:456
msgid "Which way the bands run."
msgstr "扫描条带的延伸方向。"

